SUMMARY

For non-commercial purposes, the license allows copying, sharing, and
adaptation of the licensed material. When sharing it, retain the supplied
creator and copyright information, license and disclaimer notices, and
material reference as required by the license. Identify modifications and
include a reference to CC BY-NC 4.0. Do not imply endorsement by the creators.

Do not impose terms or technical barriers that prevent recipients from
exercising rights granted by the license. Non-commercial use is determined
by the purpose of the use, rather than institutional affiliation alone.
Permissions validly granted remain in effect while the license is followed.
The official legal text specifies the full conditions and exceptions.

EXCLUDED RIGHTS AND MATERIAL

This notice does not grant rights in the original source recordings, video
clips, video frames, audio, images, or third-party rights in the original
dialogue reproduced in transcripts. Those rights remain with their respective
holders. Any contributor-held rights in transcript preparation do not confer
rights in the underlying dialogue.

Raw videos, edited clips, frames, and audio files are not distributed as part
of the TriCoME dataset release. Source-recording URLs are supplied to help
researchers locate the original material; they are not permissions to reuse it.

This grant does not supply permissions for privacy, publicity, or other
personality rights that the contributors do not control. It also does not
license software or model weights unless those materials are expressly
identified as covered by this grant.

INITIAL ACCESS

The request-and-acknowledgment process administers initial delivery from the
dataset maintainers. It does not restrict non-commercial redistribution or
adaptation otherwise permitted by CC BY-NC 4.0.

WARRANTIES

The licensed material is supplied without warranties, subject to the
